{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120305001:0":{"text":"미안. 아르사… 누나… 콜록, 아파… 콜록!","source_cn":"对不起，阿尔萨，咳咳，姐姐……我还是……咳咳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE24D1748766E92E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120305002:0":{"text":"약도 먹었는데 왜 낫질 않는 거지…","source_cn":"明明已经吃了药，为什么病情还是没有好转……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EB243C3F9F2BA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120305003:1":{"text":"흠, 효과를 보려면 시간이 지나야 하는 거 아닐까요?","source_cn":"呃，难道是还没到起效的时间？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EFEB98B94A0BB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120305004:1":{"text":"바보야! 약을 먹은 지 한참이나 됐는데, 진작에 효과가 나왔겠지!","source_cn":"笨蛋满满，药都喝了这么久了，早就该起作用了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38FEADAD863710FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120305005:0":{"text":"어떡하지… 이 방법 말고 다른 치료법은 모르는데…","source_cn":"怎么办……除了这种草药，我不知道其他治疗的办法了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A51353F9C950119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120305006:0":{"text":"다 내 탓이야. 일찍 알아차렸어야 하는데… 전부 내 잘못이야…","source_cn":"都怪我，如果我早点发现问题就好了……都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD31311931EBE5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120305006":{"text":"다 내 탓이야. 일찍 알아차렸어야 하는데… 전부 내 잘못이야…","source_cn":"都怪我，如果我早点发现问题就好了……都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD31311931EBE5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120305007:1":{"text":"그래. 조바심 내봤자 무슨 소용 있겠어… 미안, 내가 너무 급했어.","source_cn":"你说得对，我现在着急也没有用……抱歉，是我急昏头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49997F3FF46AFA5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120305008:1":{"text":"괜찮아요! 전에 아르사가 독비수에 상처 입고 기절했을 때, 우리도 다들 안절부절못했는걸요!","source_cn":"没关系！之前阿尔萨被毒匕首刺伤晕倒的时候，大家也是这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x772BA3843884A28F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120305009:1":{"text":"독비수… 기절…","source_cn":"毒匕首……晕倒……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6368832246413809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120305010:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 그 당시 날 치료해 준 사람이 누구야?","source_cn":"说起来，之前我在战歌节上受伤的那次，是谁把我治好的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C74D04548ADFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120305011:1":{"text":"스모키라는 미어캣이었어. 제약사라고 하던데…","source_cn":"那只叫阿熏的狐獴。他好像很擅长制药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3193B23195DE212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120305012:1":{"text":"정말 그렇게 대단하다면 카루엔의 병을 낫게 할 수도…","source_cn":"如果他真的这么厉害的话，不知道能不能帮帮这孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F11DEAB7DB5B5DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1120305012":{"text":"정말 그렇게 대단하다면 카루엔의 병을 낫게 할 수도…","source_cn":"如果他真的这么厉害的话，不知道能不能帮帮这孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F11DEAB7DB5B5DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120305013:1":{"text":"그래, 나도 그렇게 생각해.","source_cn":"嗯，我也这么觉得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722E484FBF2CBDDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120305015:1":{"text":"음… 그나저나 그 스모키라는 분은 어디서 찾아야 하지?","source_cn":"唔……可是，我们现在要去哪里找到这位阿熏呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76FA3B785D49A903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120305016:1":{"text":"군가 축제 때 칼라가 스모키를 데려왔던 걸로 기억해. 칼라는 알고 있을지도 몰라.","source_cn":"我记得之前在战歌节上，是曼卡拉把他带过来的。我们可以找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA55636F05C904BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120305017:1":{"text":"그래. 카루엔의 치료를 더는 지체해선 안 돼.","source_cn":"好。这孩子的病情应该也不能再耽误了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4861CAC57D35E985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120305018:0":{"text":"콜록, 콜록… 흑… 아르사 누나, 어디 가…?","source_cn":"咳、咳咳……呜……阿尔萨姐姐，你们要去哪里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8765F884218F1637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1120305019:0":{"text":"착하지. 누나가 약 찾아올게. 그 약을 먹으면 금방 나을 거야.","source_cn":"乖孩子，我们要去帮你找药。吃下那种药，你就会好起来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61CECDB565B3BD36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120305020:0":{"text":"그러니까 우리가 돌아올 때까지 아파도 버티고 있어 줘. 알았지?","source_cn":"所以在我们回来之前，不管多难受你都要坚持住，好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B2D9954D90C3B69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1120305021:1":{"text":"다른 분들에게 너를 돌봐달라고 부탁해 둘게.","source_cn":"我会拜托其他人好好照顾你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D21DD8A5E9F19B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1120305022:0":{"text":"응! 콜록, 콜록… 누나가 올 때까지 기다리고 있을게!","source_cn":"好！咳，咳……我相信阿尔萨姐姐！我会乖乖等你们回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE444E6A0A443162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1120305023:1":{"text":"…카루엔의 상태를 보니 더는 지체하면 안 될 것 같아요.","source_cn":"……这孩子的情况，应该不能再拖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0191736D40B772B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1120305024:1":{"text":"맞아. 얼른 전투장에 가서 칼라를 찾아야 해!","source_cn":"嗯。事不宜迟，我们赶紧去武斗场找曼卡拉吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3085D95B8085C95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"좋은 생각이야","source_cn":"值得一试。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE91C4C16D8687F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"좋은 생각이야","female":"좋은 생각이야","variant_male_record_index":"63362","variant_female_record_index":"63363","document_title":"","document_title_m